<title>USA: FSI International Inc Q1 net drops.</title>
<headline>FSI International Inc Q1 net drops.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>(in thousands, except per share data)</p>
<p>						     First Quarter Ended</p>
<p>						   Nov 30,	  Nov 25,</p>
<p>						    1996	    1995(1)</p>
<p> Sales					   $66,991	  $70,344</p>
<p> Operating income				3,868	    8,515</p>
<p> Minority interest			     (115)	    (162)</p>
<p> Equity in earnings of affiliates	  1,024	    1,556</p>
<p> Net income					4,041	    7,725</p>
<p> Net income per common share		   .18		.33</p>
<p> Weighted average common shares	   23,014	   23,323</p>
<p>Pro forma data: (2)</p>
<p>   Net income				    4,041	    7,654</p>
<p>   Earnings per share			    .18		.33</p>
<p>NOTE: (1) The Nov. 25, 1995 quarterly financial data have been restated to reflect the acquisition of Semiconductor Systems Inc, which was completed as of April 4, 1996 using the pooling of interest method of accounting.</p>
<p>(2) The Pro forma data includes adjustments for the effect of recognizing income tax expense for Semiconductor Systems as if it had been a C Corp versus an S Corp prior to the acquisition.</p>
</text>
